[
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "07f3a3109bb824f7b7ef6816ed2fe2e26c8b62e8e824572f22c34d5856211e2b",
    "target": "乔克逃走了……卡林兹，你有好好监视他吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "4b9f5ef09fbde39028edae2bb36e34686bea4e3aefba7f1d7567822e806abcba",
    "target": "……谁知道呢。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "ef52a29382bbee4b4b05a00d62be276332d06409a2f4ac8a157139dafb7e816d",
    "target": "我只能认为，是你故意放走了他。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "80fb3fe2baea3ebd9877eb22084db67a37f028115e350945cc34f26695b470e1",
    "target": "多亏那家伙，我们才得到了菲莉西亚，这也是事实。总该给点小小的回报吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "dee0e4dd991942c5fb775f8dc0befb4b31d8fe6070833566438ada1f9c6e8dee",
    "target": "像你这样肆意违反军法的人，我还是第一次见。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "041670f9f9eef3bc8d7ecaae478cec48c62762b1decac8511b8f561219df4f18",
    "target": "如果不满意，随时把我赶走就是。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "dcfbbc1cb8de66e918bd4f38b6df6450699f6a8842f98abc5a896da25e9aaa37",
    "target": "你越这么说，我倒越想把你留下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "eef2a89ed76eadbf046e37c0661f68792994de375fa717ecd9aaf7fe9a4049c6",
    "target": "说实话，吉拉特近卫队也想把我赶走。不过，赫利俄斯陛下太疼爱我了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "413d733d69a0fcf1521b3437fab108ed023cd8ffc2ac7085986f1b5659773aa2",
    "target": "虽说最后，还是被别的人赶走了……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "dab1d8f1f39fb12d20517a3625c882a5b1e70116a3374e618a758165dc540247",
    "target": "不过，乔克就算逃出去，也无处可去。斯卡拉姆修会接纳他这个叛徒吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "1ad4a06aa754deaf255a842fd3ff79da8bf74c00466bed78b754c12b1527c3df",
    "target": "擅自逃走的是他，之后该怎么办，他自己想办法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "c5039db1f5da7ef0c1dd29ef150909a80873f59bdb0586bb0783f5055a03e857",
    "target": "……你这个组长，总还是有好好顾及组员吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "b8ca073f88fa10248e1a2ac9ddc633aff824609d4b26cda5ea0c29d547f2026d",
    "target": "我可没打算连那些家伙的生活都照料。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0190.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "6f118a3d5f73b073c33b08255ccfa67c50450cff0211e50dd963a2e584317ace",
    "target": "……明白了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "f9900b8be51d3c22e21fefd3443f96accde36fb2bbd3e082b81f67f31d9775ee",
    "target": "乔克逃走了……卡林兹，你有好好监视他吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "406552053596bada7f7418bf139486277c2a84dd8cd834ed5a949a92d614b195",
    "target": "……谁知道呢。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "ef52a29382bbee4b4b05a00d62be276332d06409a2f4ac8a157139dafb7e816d",
    "target": "我只能认为，是你故意放走了他。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "80fb3fe2baea3ebd9877eb22084db67a37f028115e350945cc34f26695b470e1",
    "target": "多亏那家伙，我们才得到了菲莉西亚，这也是事实。总该给点小小的回报吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "dee0e4dd991942c5fb775f8dc0befb4b31d8fe6070833566438ada1f9c6e8dee",
    "target": "像你这样肆意违反军法的人，我还是第一次见。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "041670f9f9eef3bc8d7ecaae478cec48c62762b1decac8511b8f561219df4f18",
    "target": "如果不满意，随时把我赶走就是。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "dcfbbc1cb8de66e918bd4f38b6df6450699f6a8842f98abc5a896da25e9aaa37",
    "target": "你越这么说，我倒越想把你留下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "d52adebc5f8f9b21187b9f88ad29fe392d0ce0f7e8b16cce9a88475c5ba0a62c",
    "target": "说实话，吉拉特近卫队也想把我赶走。不过，赫利俄斯陛下太宠爱我了。虽说最后，还是被别的人赶走了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "dab1d8f1f39fb12d20517a3625c882a5b1e70116a3374e618a758165dc540247",
    "target": "不过，乔克就算逃出去，也无处可去。斯卡拉姆修会接纳他这个叛徒吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "1ad4a06aa754deaf255a842fd3ff79da8bf74c00466bed78b754c12b1527c3df",
    "target": "擅自逃走的是他，之后该怎么办，他自己想办法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "6e361b6d76a88f333f4f56cd422a74e2907ec892b39800c9eee8546a6d29239d",
    "target": "……你这个组长，总还是有好好顾及组员吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "e099d377e607554d13eb755bd3b28e0339cc7ab5fde60d1b38002d3c10368b4f",
    "target": "我可没打算连那些家伙的生活都照料。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "51a590630ce6320956b2cd0a402db12bd96107c1512bae0d9d38b0a8b9fd95b2",
    "target": "……明白了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "d268c1e29d59781c41478260ce75d899433da489aac04de48f526c6698f0b3aa",
    "target": "所有贵族都要聚集，真是盛大的舞会。请我出席，也不过是出于礼貌吧……威尔莱特爵士，你怎么看？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "6642e17487fd470119427dadc51915d10fe155d55baba4f159069feb0c621ba4",
    "target": "这个嘛，出席与否，都是殿下的自由。不过，特意去一趟，也不会有什么损失。支持拉德琳娜的人，大多会参加这场舞会，趁机大致看看都有谁，也不错。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "9dceb0d9a81e26a1a5b8c7d77600b312e5da4b03b1c1049dfe8cb437734f8a95",
    "target": "说得也是。毕竟，拉德琳娜经常举办的茶会，我一次也没参加过……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "f82346edbd8b7c32c3e096b70e9fc7d02525ba3ab0384b0bb681bb33d2d0a94e",
    "target": "陛下似乎也希望殿下出席。殿下过去几乎不曾参加一般的社交聚会。陛下担心再发生上次那样不愉快的事，因此表示，会派施瓦茨·施图尔姆第7组担任护卫。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "64e19bc84bed50aeaeb3cae23df4c65379b397f2f0b3251b5c1369b1f4f6292e",
    "target": "施瓦茨·施图尔姆第7组？这玩笑也太过分了。要让那种身份低微的人来护卫我？这是把我当成无依无靠的乡下皇女了吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "51df6d91ca7384709d636c6b9ea83a3f87a505ab7b9a4404fd9b940de4e1cc61",
    "target": "不过，陛下信任那些人。虽然说是运气好，但他们确实救过陛下。要是吉尔伯特总队长同意，说不定已经被赐予很高的职位了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0191.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "0f9e7a7eb78c4a6fbaa1816c96a8c85276e96de2606b9ebf22eaf6d25c158961",
    "target": "……原来如此。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d4334630e021666cb6bda7592bccc6c59b94372f2ab80cd03d40cd6db09554b0",
    "target": "护卫皇女殿下啊……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:1:12",
    "source_sha256": "39279b04a165163a68e8ec749cc703dec8f6a5ffe79a312f2385bb6770bea3db",
    "target": "是威严的皇帝陛下亲自下令，也没办法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:2:1",
    "source_sha256": "4d2ae9d434ac59c0458c3e2b23d5ae21d55c674fd4e3bc1fb79378b05d5d1051",
    "target": "那种舞会，我们能去吗？所有人看到我们，都要嘀嘀咕咕。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:3:2",
    "source_sha256": "53e288a0f23ab5b4436373e66897a8107ac1f875283ddf3a957d102207189d20",
    "target": "很遗憾，我们只能按命令行事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:4:3",
    "source_sha256": "2541b36dd9031612a6adc8153018693504efd20e3094391b52502978e8a40613",
    "target": "谁不知道这一点。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:5:4",
    "source_sha256": "775daeee23e5e8d327d454d8fe0e9f5eee9bfb80c11376d809213c8efe4e76ae",
    "target": "不过，把菲莉西亚带到那种地方，真的没问题吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:6:14",
    "source_sha256": "d4348f2e7ecb44de6b35b5e859cfea3bdabebdd5c332d0596b3fc1dd5ac21183",
    "target": "她还什么都不明白，甚至不知道自己已经是施瓦茨的人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:7:5",
    "source_sha256": "39314b7c5d991bfab87d205716ed3642fa80774235d41a4c834cc1317e6bfa1e",
    "target": "那天，我不打算特意宣布，护卫皇女殿下的是施瓦茨第7组。我们会混在普通护卫之中，不露身份地执行护卫任务。只是这样，应该没问题。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:8:6",
    "source_sha256": "8cc1c499cc9ccebf8f8e87e9628b0ec3715a01fac5240c58cdcd804ccb6062ce",
    "target": "可我还是不太情愿。施瓦茨本来就和皇女合不来。这种情况下，让我们护卫皇女殿下……很容易招来误会。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:9:7",
    "source_sha256": "0ffb423651dd5fc88b21150c317bb47a0ee77901c25e6f1ff8ba53ba863f501e",
    "target": "目前的部署是，我和切尔西在奥拉坎府邸内，罗普玛和菲莉西亚在府邸外。所以，菲莉西亚就由罗普玛留意着。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:10:8",
    "source_sha256": "c65e7109f9693b0416dcf8c12485909a4a5a3b75d48cf0f48fe83b88a35db0ff",
    "target": "咦，为什么把罗普玛和菲莉西亚安排在一起？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:11:9",
    "source_sha256": "87770bee88ac60888c38faa5b431b4c93f2d84493f0cae858de0fc7c63739599",
    "target": "你和我多少懂些礼仪。罗普玛和菲莉西亚却一窍不通。进去以后万一出什么差错，会很难办。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:12:10",
    "source_sha256": "aeb5c66ed4ee378d702cae2c15732575921571b51026dced0f073b41d01a51d6",
    "target": "啊，这倒也是……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0192.fpb:text:13:11",
    "source_sha256": "30bfd2008fceb8d7dda39e09324a4cedcfc2739f08634b315a5645b172f4ec3e",
    "target": "……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0193.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "7f487dae25ef57c6513fb58a5197a7f20a9a483ecece6a03c1ebdac1d74387ea",
    "target": "我和切尔西会进入奥拉坎府邸。万一有事，立刻联络。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0193.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "fbb3a26b802779985ccf3a9c6c1e177ae56cdc707908cfd9b7bf39419939dec3",
    "target": "哎呀，真不错。舞会里不是会有一大堆像样的美食吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0193.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "e0770b8d567b414d04812f44c3e5528cdce66d9726e9a291ebd1c039d3c8db55",
    "target": "我们是来工作，不是来吃东西的。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0193.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "48dcc371dac445a3f2dad12cf01af77fbf6e574b58baf51f2fd038e314090fb0",
    "target": "开玩笑的，怎么还当真了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "f3345143792f895774d12ff81ede23f6bd6d40c5ecfb0fec3a34c4b81561536f",
    "target": "卡林兹·杰尔比南，拜见皇女殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "d8efd54550e299625c592215eca944eef241f7e703111104de2c944b9d0c6797",
    "target": "好久不见，卡林兹。从那天以后，这是第一次见面吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "242de76e8cb46d0c07215308c8825ee1e0f1dd20ac3ca0028ad4e13755de66b6",
    "target": "是，殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "a31c14db08e070ba383af035930f733ef72cedf0a48b13b7b32541876b596a29",
    "target": "谢谢今天特意来护卫我。居然让施瓦茨最下等的组来护卫，真是出乎意料。也是，你们那天运气好，当了救世主，得到了陛下全部的信任……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "c6a1606f0bbd86dc9ec2a9d3d050f0ce3707087d60d3d452afaff268178ef450",
    "target": "恕我冒昧，殿下。我们第7组总是承担需要亲身奔走的艰苦任务。也许在殿下眼中不值一提，可比起这里雇用的半吊子护卫，应该有用得多。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "f7b11a70f77d068a178e55152bfd838a9b9a3221d39f8e0b9a3295ebf14bef3b",
    "target": "不愧是吉尔伯特总队长的妹妹。听说原本不过是普通平民……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "6ae0c68f4b066ed8665027b3558b5ad41f9d16372bdf41959121739741f6e9b6",
    "target": "殿下希望施瓦茨全由贵族组成吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "f7acab576dd51aee36b1103dd5ee504017b0449ccb15e5f35c52186ab4269c05",
    "target": "不，不管是谁，施瓦茨都一样。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "9166b8bdb4dd404a972dbda9de9c737162547f211f6815db81c9b096c73f943f",
    "target": "原来您在这里，殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0194.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "34e4427e45729a50ccf9939b19262418fa4b6326dfe2a5d94545a265dde47cac",
    "target": "衷心感谢今天的邀请，奥拉坎。",
    "state": "translated"
